{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/005-zhong-si/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0002-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/005-zhong-si/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0002-1/data.json","title":"詩經注析 · 螽斯羽，诜诜兮。宜尔子孙，振振兮。 · 程俊英、蒋见元","description":"螽斯是一类多子的虫，又名蚣蝑、斯螽。诜诜为众多貌。书中又引马瑞辰说“宜”有“多”义，因此“宜尔子孙”就是祝福对方子孙众多；“尔”指被祝贺的人，不宜解作螽斯。至于“振振”，作者从王先谦之说，以为有振奋有为之意，不取毛传“仁厚、信厚”的解释。本章韵读属文部。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"005-zhong-si","materialId":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","glossId":"0002-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/005-zhong-si/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0002-1","poem":{"id":"005-zhong-si","title":"螽斯","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"zhounan","path":["風","周南","螽斯"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"螽斯羽","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"诜诜兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"宜尔子孙","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"振振兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"螽斯羽","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"薨薨兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"宜尔子孙","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"绳绳兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"螽斯羽","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"揖揖兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"宜尔子孙","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"蛰蛰兮","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","title":"詩經注析","authors":["程俊英","蔣見元"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","era":"现代","publicationYear":1991,"carrier":"PDF"},"annotation":{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":4,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"螽斯羽，诜诜兮。宜尔子孙，振振兮。","targetNotes":"第一章。","sourceLabel":"第 36 页","sourceNotes":"第 36 页上半。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":null,"text":"螽斯是一类多子的虫，又名蚣蝑、斯螽。诜诜为众多貌。书中又引马瑞辰说“宜”有“多”义，因此“宜尔子孙”就是祝福对方子孙众多；“尔”指被祝贺的人，不宜解作螽斯。至于“振振”，作者从王先谦之说，以为有振奋有为之意，不取毛传“仁厚、信厚”的解释。本章韵读属文部。","notes":"据第 36 页第一章注释。"}]},"siblings":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"layerLabel":"全篇总说","title":"这是一首祝人多子多孙的诗，体式与《樛木》相近","href"